35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Transport is huge, 38% of costs if we go far.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,Cooking duty took two hours a day last year.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Inland clubs slept eight to a room with lights out at eleven.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Public beds are 1,100 yen a night, all-inclusive.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
