53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, I agree, the coastal lodge feels more open.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, I need to see the final numbers before I agree.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
